WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
47 is below 48. The guard returns false.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.400
48 is the included lower bound. The guard returns true.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.600
159 is below 160. The guard returns true.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.800
160 is the excluded upper bound. The guard returns false.
